25            5                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    Black and white photograph taken at Marloes Sands in Pembrokeshire, West Wales. Photography by Mark Lloyd Williams. This is a beautifully produced giclee print on heavyweight fine art paper using archival pigment inks (fade-resistant for many, many decades) Available in a range of "A" format sizes ("A" format frames are available in just about any homeware store) or we can frame it for you in a strongly made solid pine frame with a hand-waxed black finish. Frames are glazed with 2mm acrylic favoured by most galleries as it's stronger and safer than glass and far superior to the "styrene" plastic glass usually used in budget frames which tends to yellow over time. We can offer superb print and frame quality at a very reasonable price as we make everything ourselves: artwork is from our own art studio, printing is done at our own print room and frames are made in our own carpentry workshop. Black Mountain Gallery is a small family business based at the edge of the beautiful Brecon Beacons National Park in Wales.\n\nA6 UNFRAMED = 14.5 X 10.5cm\nA6 FRAMED = 19.4 X 15cm\nA5 UNFRAMED = 21 X 14.9cm\nA5 FRAMED = 19.4 X 25cm\nA4 UNFRAMED = 21 X 29.7cm\nA4 FRAMED = 34.4 X 25.5cm\nA3 UNFRAMED = 42 X 29.7cm\nA3 FRAMED = 46.5 X 34.2cm     system                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         